  "description": "Spearfish C Eagle 90 Transmission is one of the most balanced endurance XC bikes you’ll find out there. Why? Its responsive carbon frame features geometry that positions you for pedaling all day comfortably and navigating techy sections confidently. Its Split Pivot suspension design allows for both optimized pedaling and braking performance so your 120mm of suspension travel is always keeping you planted and in control.\n\nWhen you want to put in big miles (and why wouldn’t you on a bike this fun?), Spearfish is ready with adaptable cargo mounts including direct-mount frame bag capability, and room for up to three bottles on MD–XL frames. Finally, SRAM’s Eagle 90 Transmission componentry offers the reliability of mechanical shifting and backcountry-ready durability.",
